kern-inkling-2mini

CUDA/Triton operators and build/manifest tooling are adapted from the Apache-2.0
projects kern (https://github.com/pegainfer-project/kern), kern-qwen38
(https://github.com/pegainfer-project/kern-qwen38), and kern-k31
(https://github.com/pegainfer-project/kern-k31). See upstreams.json for per-file
origins and original hashes.

FlashInfer is an unmodified git submodule pinned to
023a8474e1f7469572c0d4284535fc6ffa699574. See third_party/flashinfer/LICENSE and
its upstream copyright notices.

Inkling-2-Mini model architecture, precision rules, and DSpark speculative
decoding protocol follow Thinking Machines Lab's Inkling-2-Mini specification.
